Attribution
-----------

This project builds on the educational brute-force example presented
by David J. Malan in "Securing Accounts", part of CS50's Introduction
to Cybersecurity.

Lesson:
https://cs50.harvard.edu/cybersecurity/notes/0/

Related educational source code:
https://github.com/dmalan/cybersecurity

CS50 course license:
https://cs50.harvard.edu/cybersecurity/license/

The original course materials are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
Rights to those materials remain with their respective rights holders.

Project adaptations include combination counting and execution-time
measurement. Further development is documented in the Git history.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Harvard University,
CS50, or David J. Malan.